  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Saga of the Great Wolf",
    "summary": "Your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units that have this ability, other than **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** units, get these 3 abilities:\n\n**Encircling Jaws**: while the unit has the **assault doctrine** active, it gets +1 to its [Charge](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step) and [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) rolls.\n\n**Hunter’s Eye**: while the unit has the **devastator doctrine** active, it can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) with its ranged attacks.\n\n**Ferocious Strike**: while the unit has the **tactical doctrine** active, its attacks against enemy units up to 9\" from it get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n\nYour **LOGAN GRIMNAR** units get this ability:\n\n**Howling Onslaught**: For your whole army, once per battle, you can use this in [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). Your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES MONSTER** and **ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE** units then also benefit from **Master of Wolves** until your next Command phase.\n\nYour army can contain **SPACE WOLVES** units, and no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
